SCOPE

This license covers the original Kiln code and documents in this repository
(kiln.py, kilnlib/, tools/, tests/, docs/ and the files at the top level).
Files under bakers/ are copied from the upstream project the port is built on
and keep that project's license (bakers/LICENSE, bakers/NOTICE), which has its
own non-commercial restriction; third-party components keep their own
licenses (see NOTICE).

