NOTE ON GAME CONTENT

This license covers only the original source code and binaries of this
repository. It grants NO rights to any third-party game data, and this
repository contains none: no game files, no extracted or converted files, no
game code.

This project is provided for interoperability, preservation, and homebrew use
with a copy of the source game that you legally own. It ships no game assets;
it operates solely on client files supplied by the user, on the user's own
computer. The files it writes are made from the user's own copy for the
user's own use and must not be distributed by anyone: do not distribute game
data, files converted from it, or builds or archives that contain them.

All trademarks and copyrighted game content remain the property of their
respective owners. This project is not affiliated with, authorized, or
endorsed by any game publisher or by the maker of the PSP.

Rightsholders with concerns are welcome to contact the maintainer at
sandstonedevpsp@gmail.com before filing a formal notice.
